                            	   767: UpdateBlock_JumpTable:
02:00039FBC 00039FC8        	   768:     dc.l    UpdateBlock0Idle   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:00039FC0 0003A0B2        	   769:     dc.l    UpdateBlock1Moving   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
