                            	  6155: _L_z04_CheckBigDigdoggerCollisions_LoopCornerCollision:
                            	  6156:     ; Digdogger is big, but room boundary checks and
                            	  6157:     ; object collision checks assume a 16x16 monster or smaller.
                            	  6158:     ; Therefore, we have to check these things four times,
                            	  6159:     ; in different corners of the boss.
                            	  6160:     ;
                            	  6161:     ; Loop 4 times, from 0 to 3.
                            	  6162:     ;
