                            	  6888: UpdateDodongoState_JumpTable:
02:0003CBA8 0003CBB4        	  6889:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState0_Move   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:0003CBAC 0003CC18        	  6890:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState1_Bloated   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
