02:0003CC26 0003CC3A        	  6955:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState1_Bloated_Sub_Wait   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:0003CC2A 0003CC3A        	  6956:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState1_Bloated_Sub_Wait   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:0003CC2E 0003CC3A        	  6957:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState1_Bloated_Sub_Wait   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
